          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lingibizelani ngokuthi: Nkosi, Nkosi — lingakwenzi engikutshoyo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yilowo lalowo oza kimi, awezwe amazwi ami, awenze, ngizakulitshengisa lowo afana laye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ufana lomuntu owathi esakha indlu yakhe, wemba watshonisa, wabeka isisekelo phezu kwedwala. Ekufikeni kwempophoma umfula watshaya kuleyondlu, kodwa wawungelamandla okuyinyikinya, ngoba yayakhiwe kuhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa owezwayo engawenzi, unjengomuntu owakha indlu yakhe emhlabathini, ingelasisekelo; umfula wayitshaya, yahle yawa; kwaba kukhulu ukudilika kwaleyondlu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.49"
            ]
          }
        }
